      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2026, the historic studio complex was designated a Los Angeles Historic‑Cultural Monument, preserving its early Hollywood legacy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
